<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73383" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅμαιμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the same blood, related
				by blood,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.151
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				433
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				192
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					653
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνος ὅ.</span> murder <i>by
				one near of kin,</i> ib. <i><span class="en">
				212
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> mostly as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅμαιμος, ὁ</span>
			or ἡ, <i>brother</i> or <i>sister,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				681
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				605
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῆς ὁ. καὶ κασιγνήτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν σὴν ὅ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				325
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BMus.Inscr.</u>
				1036.6
			</span></i> (Caria, <span class="entity">ii/i B. C.</span>) : 
				Boeot.
			 gen. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμήμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corinn.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					2.68
				</span></i>
			.</div>
